{"title":"Wolf","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 2 Wolf that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/wolf-sinew\">Wolf Sinew</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(27.5px,-26.1px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-1/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-1/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:0px\"><i style=\"left:-28.9px;top:27.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:-9.6px;top:-30.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:-13.8px;top:-31.3px\"></i></div><figcaption>Imp Tree</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Imp%20Tree\">Imp Tree</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Smoldering%20Den\">Smoldering Den</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"wolf\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Wolf: <a href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf\">Dire Wolf</a> <span class=\"muted\">(20)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/grayback-wolf\">Grayback Wolf</a> <span class=\"muted\">(26)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/elder-wolf\">Elder Wolf</a> <span class=\"muted\">(32)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/85ccd064a1e12ca21250.svg\" alt=\"Wolf\"></div><h3>Wolf</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>2 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 2–3)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Wolf</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>14</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>2.2</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>100</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>2.9 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>6 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}